<!--
    strings_jemma.xml — DEFAULT LOCALE (English).

    JemmaAppDemo follows the Google Play best-practice of using English as the
    default fallback locale. When the device is set to a locale we don't ship
    a translation for (e.g. German, Spanish), Android resolves to this file.

    Translations live in :
      • values-fr/strings_jemma.xml  (French)
      • values-ja/strings_jemma.xml  (Japanese)

    The Edge Gallery `strings.xml` (com.google.ai.edge.gallery) is left
    untouched in this same `values/` directory ; it provides the strings used
    by Google's Compose UI which we don't render in the demo.

    Conventions :
      • Keys prefixed by their feature scope (home_, perso_, allergy_, …)
      • IPS-related strings cite the FHIR R4 resource type explicitly so the
        jury can verify the IPS mapping
      • Single quotes escaped as `\'`
      • Newlines in long strings use `\n`
-->
